  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A grid of twenty small grey airbrushed creatures, four legged animals and running figures, in loose soft shapes on cream paper.",
    "description": "A square airbrush painting on cream paper. Twenty small grey figures in four rows, each sprayed as soft blobs with no outlines: four legged animals like dogs or deer with raised tails, upright figures running, crouching or bowing, a striped one at left in row three, and a long legged figure striding at bottom centre. The forms are loose and smoky, with limbs that taper to points. No background.",
    "impression": "The animal and action companion to the pod character sheet, looser and more like ink blots coming alive. The creatures are caught mid run or mid stretch, and the softness makes them feel like shadows of animals rather than animals. A page from a bestiary drawn in smoke.",
